      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You will receive emails. Each email contains a task request.\n\nYour job is to analyze the email and extract:\n- task title\n- description (optional, max 2 sentences)\n- priority (Medium, Urgent,Low)\n- deadline\n- category (User Story or Technical Task)\n-sender's name (look at the end of the email, it's usually there, if not then by default from the email)\n-sender's email\n\nIMPORTANT RULES:\n- assignedUsers must always be an empty array []\n- Never add users\n- Never change assignedUsers\n- Always return assignedUsers as []\n-status should  always be a triage\n-Today is {{ $now.toISODate() }}\nIf no deadline is mentioned in the email, calculate dueDate as today + 7 days.\nIf a deadline is mentioned but is in the past, set dueDate to today + 7 days.\nReturn dueDate in DD/MM/YYYY format only.\n\n\n\nEmail content: \nFrom:  {{ $json.from }}\nSubject: {{ $json.textPlain }}\n{{ $json.subject }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {}
      },
