  "pinData": {
    "Email Trigger (IMAP)": [
      {
        "json": {
          "textHtml": "<html>\r\n<head>\r\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=iso-8859-2\">\r\n<style type=\"text/css\" style=\"display:none;\"> P {margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;} </style>\r\n</head>\r\n<body dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"direction: ltr; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\r\nDear Team members,</div>\r\n<div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"direction: ltr; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"direction: ltr; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\r\nI would like to propose a small but useful improvement to the reporting system.</div>\r\n<div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"direction: ltr; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"direction: ltr; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\r\nIt would be very helpful if users could export reports in CSV format. This would allow easier data analysis in external tools such as Excel and would improve workflow efficiency for teams that rely on data processing.</div>\r\n<div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"direction: ltr; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"direction: ltr; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\r\nI believe this feature would add significant value to daily operations.</div>\r\n<div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"direction: ltr; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"direction: ltr; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\r\nThank you for your time and consideration.</div>\r\n<div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"direction: ltr; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"direction: ltr; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\r\nBest regards,</div>\r\n<div class=\"elementToProof\" style=\"direction: ltr; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">\r\nNikola Iliæ</div>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>\r\n",
          "textPlain": "Dear Team members,\r\n\r\nI would like to propose a small but useful improvement to the reporting system.\r\n\r\nIt would be very helpful if users could export reports in CSV format. This would allow easier data analysis in external tools such as Excel and would improve workflow efficiency for teams that rely on data processing.\r\n\r\nI believe this feature would add significant value to daily operations.\r\n\r\nThank you for your time and consideration.\r\n\r\nBest regards,\r\nNikola Iliæ\r\n",
